{"id":"wb-7-1305","name":"三江白塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三江白塔","text":"三江白塔位于中国四川省井研县三江镇，是一座宋代密檐式塔，2007年6月1日公布为第七批四川省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n三江白塔平面呈方形，共13层，高28米，为密檐式塔型，砖木结构。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E6%B1%9F%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93099165,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93099165","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b3485c8092fc6c952ec68f1e.jpg","title":"Jingyan_Sanjiang_Baita_2014.04.24_17-34-14.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingyan_Sanjiang_Baita_2014.04.24_17-34-14.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Jingyan_Sanjiang_Baita_2014.04.24_17-34-14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"井研县三江白塔","width":320,"height":480}}